From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:54:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: pinctrl: sun55i-a523: Allow power-source in pin
 groups

The A523 and the A733 supply pin bank PF from two rails, 3.3 V and
1.8 V, and select between them in the pin controller. An SD card slot
on bank PF needs that switch for UHS signalling.

Allow the generic power-source property in pin groups, in microvolts.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the SD card pin groups
with power-source set to 1800000 and 3300000 are accepted and applied
(GPIO_POW_VAL_SET_CTL bit 0 reads 0 and 1).

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../bindings/pinctrl/allwinner,sun55i-a523-pinctrl.yaml    | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/allwinner,sun55i-a523-pinctrl.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/allwinner,sun55i-a523-pinctrl.yaml
index d7d0ba32ced4..02f7a0ab6882 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/allwinner,sun55i-a523-pinctrl.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/allwinner,sun55i-a523-pinctrl.yaml
@@ -99,6 +99,13 @@ patternProperties:
           pins will repeat the last value, to allow just specifying a single
           cell, for all cells.
 
+      power-source:
+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+        description:
+          I/O voltage of the bank, in microvolts. Only bank PF can switch
+          it, between its two supplies.
+        enum: [1800000, 3300000]
+
     required:
       - pins
       - allwinner,pinmux
